sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]
    participant Peripheral as BLE Peripheral

    Note over Node, Peripheral: Messages between Node and BLE Peripheral<br>are link-layer events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through<br>Echo callbacks (e.g. CurrentState).

    App->>Node: GapCentral.PairAndBond()

    alt Just Works - new bond (no user interaction)
        Note over App, Node: Negotiated when MITM protection is not required<br>or IoCapabilities do not support authentication.
        rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
            Note over Node, Peripheral: LESC SMP over L2CAP
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_Request
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Response
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_Public_Key
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Public_Key
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Confirm
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_Random
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Random
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_DHKey_Check
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_DHKey_Check
            Note over Node, Peripheral: LL encryption setup
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_ENC_REQ
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_ENC_RSP
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_START_ENC_REQ (encrypted)
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
            Note over Node, Peripheral: Key distribution (encrypted)
            Peripheral-)Node: Identity_Information (IRK)
            Peripheral-)Node: Identity_Address_Information
            Peripheral-)Node: Signing_Information (CSRK)
        end
        Note over App, Node: LTK is derived from the ECDH shared secret, not distributed.
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)
    else Numeric Comparison - new bond
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=true, passkey=485923)
        Note right of App: User compares the 6-digit passkey<br>with the peer's display.
        App->>Node: GapCentral.NumericComparisonConfirm(true)
        rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
            Note over Node, Peripheral: LESC SMP stage 1 (Numeric Comparison)
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_Request (MITM requested)
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Response (MITM requested)
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_Public_Key
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Public_Key
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Confirm
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_Random
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Random
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_DHKey_Check
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_DHKey_Check
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_ENC_REQ
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_ENC_RSP
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_START_ENC_REQ (encrypted)
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
            Peripheral-)Node: Identity_Information (IRK)
            Peripheral-)Node: Identity_Address_Information
            Peripheral-)Node: Signing_Information (CSRK)
        end
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)
        Note over App: For Passkey Entry the callback carries<br>isNumericComparison=false and the App responds via<br>AuthenticateWithPasskey. SMP stage 1 then runs 20<br>Confirm / Random rounds (one per passkey bit).<br>See "Passkey Authentication" for the full flow.
    else Successful re-encryption with existing bond
        rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
            Note over Node, Peripheral: LL encryption using the stored LTK (no SMP)
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_ENC_REQ (Rand, EDIV, SKD_M, IV_M)
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_ENC_RSP (SKD_S, IV_S)
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_START_ENC_REQ (encrypted)
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
        end
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(N)
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)
        Note over App: NumberOfBondsChanged fires as a bond-aging (LRU) signal.<br>The reported N equals the current bond count and is unchanged.
    else Pairing failure
        opt Authenticated method
            alt Numeric Comparison
                Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=true, passkey=485923)
                App->>Node: GapCentral.NumericComparisonConfirm(false)
            else Passkey Entry
                Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=false, passkey=485923)
                App->>Node: GapCentral.AuthenticateWithPasskey(999999)
            end
        end
        rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_Request
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Response
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Failed (reason)
        end
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false, reason=<method-specific>)
        Note over App, Node: Reason field is method-specific:<br>numericComparisonFailed (NC) or passkeyEntryFailed (PE).<br>Other common causes: confirmValueFailed,<br>dhkeyCheckFailed (LESC), encryptionFailed (LL setup).
    else Peer-initiated disconnect during pairing
        rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_TERMINATE_IND
        end
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false, reason=unknown)
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(standby)
        Note over App, Node: PairingResult is delivered before CurrentState(standby)<br>per the proto's guaranteed response sequence for this case.
    end
